        "en": {
          "title": "target inode",
          "body": "target object"
        }
      },
      {
        "zh": {
          "title": "target data",
          "body": "目標資料"
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "target data",
          "body": "target data"
        }
      },
      {
        "zh": {
          "title": "target removed → dangling link",
          "body": "目標移除後可能斷鏈"
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "target removed → dangling link",
          "body": "May dangle when the target is removed"
        }
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "zh": "左：兩個名稱指向同一 inode。右：虛線表示解析儲存的路徑或目標移除的情況；符號連結可跨檔案系統。",
      "en": "Left: two names refer to one inode. Right: dashed lines denote path resolution or target removal. Symlinks can cross filesystem boundaries."
    }
  },
