        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Version B",
          "body": "References Hash X"
        }
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "zh": "不同版本可以參照相同的內容物件，避免為一模一樣的位元組保存重複副本。",
      "en": "Different versions can reference the same object, avoiding duplicate copies of identical bytes."
    }
